# In-container static file server for the compiled record site.
#
# The edge Caddy on cloud01 routes cairn.stump.wtf/docs/* here with the /docs
# prefix STRIPPED (handle_path), so this server sees paths rooted at the site
# root and serves the flat build/ output directly.
#
# try_files resolves directory URLs (e.g. /docs/intro/) straight to their
# index.html WITHOUT emitting file_server's canonical 308. That redirect is
# why the implicit directory handling cannot be used here: the outer proxy
# stripped /docs, so a 308 to the "canonical" path would drop the prefix and
# send the client to cairn.stump.wtf/<path>/ — the app, not the docs. Unknown
# paths fall through to the Docusaurus 404 page. Same reasoning as
# stump.wtf/switchboard's docs.Caddyfile.
:80 {
	root * /srv
	encode gzip zstd
	try_files {path} {path}/index.html /404.html
	file_server
}
